      "updated": 1700000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The book of Genesis. Chapters 1-11 set up the\nbasic storyline of the Bible. God makes humans in\nhis image to rule on his behalf. Humans choose sin\nleading up to Babylon. Big question: what is God\ngoing to do to rescue and redeem his world?",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "eee60da5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 120,
      "y": 420,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 24,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1700000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Chapters 12-14",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 15
    },
    {
