      "roundness": null,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1700000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "God calls Abraham to leave his home and go to\nCanaan. Promises a great nation, a great name,\nand blessing. Babylon tried to make a great name;\nGod gives a great name to this no-name guy.\n\nWhy? 'So that all the families of the earth\nwill find God's blessing in you.' Plan to rescue\nand bless the world through Abraham's family.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 15
    },
