      "updated": 1700000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Focuses on Abraham, Isaac, Jacob, and 12 sons.\nTwo themes: 1) Each generation marks repeated\nfailure. 2) God remains faithful, rescuing them.\n\nAbraham denies marriage out of fear. Abraham and\nSarah arrangement with servant girl. God bails\nthem out. Covenant formalized (stars in sky).\nSign of covenant: circumcision.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 15
    },
