      "updated": 1700000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Jacob lives up to his name 'Deceiver'. Cheats\nbrother Esau, deceives blind father, takes 4\nwives. Humbled by uncle Laban who cheats him.\n\nJacob returns, wrestles with God demanding\nblessing. Renamed 'Israel' (wrestles with God).",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "b4b46590",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 120,
      "y": 1040,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 24,
