      "roundness": null,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1700000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Joseph's special jacket. 10 older brothers hate\nhim, sell him to slavery in Egypt. Ends up in prison.\n\nGod is with Joseph. Pharaoh makes him second in\ncommand. Saves Egypt and his family from famine.\n\n'You planned this for evil, but God planned it for\ngood to save many lives.' Humans do evil, but\nGod remains faithful to bless.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 15
    },
