      "updated": 1700000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Genesis 3 promise: wounded victor will crush\nthe snake. Connected to line of Abraham.\n\nFrom Abraham to Judah (fourth son). Chapter 49\npoem: Jacob on deathbed blesses 12 sons.\nPredicts Judah's tribe will yield royal leaders.\nA king will come to command nations and restore\ngarden blessing to all of the world.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "aafdd92c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 620,
      "y": 1080,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 24,
